{"id":"n70823-1-10","stage":1,"title":"적당하다 · 合适","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70823-1-10-1","ko":"내 나이에 적당한 취미 생활 없을까?","zh":"我这个年纪，有没有适合的爱好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나이에","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"적당한","meaning":"合适","explanation":"적당하다：合适；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"적당하다","audio":"/audio/8fa47bf6c0a21620fef1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70823","senseId":"1","lemma":"적당하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"취미","meaning":"爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣","explanation":"취미：爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣","readings":[{"term":"취미","audio":"/audio/fce0e79fcf68c195df88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72149","senseId":"1","lemma":"취미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생활","meaning":"生活","explanation":"생활：生活","readings":[{"term":"생활","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74183","senseId":"4","lemma":"생활","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없을까?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"14","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"8fa47bf6c0a21620","term":"적당하다","zh":"合适","audio":"/audio/8fa47bf6c0a21620fef1.mp3","entryId":"70823","definition":"符合标准、条件、程度。","pronunciation":["적땅하다"]},{"id":"fce0e79fcf68c195","term":"취미","zh":"爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣","audio":"/audio/fce0e79fcf68c195df88.mp3","entryId":"72149","definition":"喜欢而为了乐趣做的事。","pronunciation":["취ː미"]},{"id":"6a739e74f8dfb7fb","term":"생활","zh":"生活","audio":"/audio/6a739e74f8dfb7fbc5ec.mp3","entryId":"74183","definition":"做某事或某个活动度日；或指那样的状态。","pronunciation":["생활"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不成立理由或可能性。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/42f9e05f8384e093d7f7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70823-1-10-2","ko":"골프를 한번 배워 보시는 건 어떨까요?","zh":"您不妨试着学学高尔夫怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"골프를","meaning":"高尔夫，高尔夫球","explanation":"골프：高尔夫，高尔夫球；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"골프","audio":"/audio/3da436a790727457a81f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27872","senseId":"1","lemma":"골프","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배워","meaning":"学，学习","explanation":"배우다：学，学习；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보시는","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떨까요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3da436a790727457","term":"골프","zh":"高尔夫，高尔夫球","audio":"/audio/3da436a790727457a81f.mp3","entryId":"27872","definition":"在广阔的草地里挖出一些小洞，以较长的球杆将一颗小球打进洞里的户外运动。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"2c65351237177855","term":"배우다","zh":"学，学习","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3","entryId":"62088","definition":"获得新知识。","pronunciation":["배우다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/16889d657c617bffa4cd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.412,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=70823","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":51,"sequenceScore":2.2387,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您不妨试着学学高尔夫怎么样？","要坐公交车去吗？","我这个年纪，有没有适合的爱好呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您不妨试着学学高尔夫怎么样？","我这个年纪，有没有适合的爱好呢？","要坐公交车去吗？"],"answer":0}]}
